    "description_html": "<div>\n<div><strong>Introducing Silver Barrel Contour Pens!</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div tabindex=\"-1\" data-testid=\"loading-message\">\n<div aria-live=\"assertive\">\n<div>\n<p>Experience the perfect blend of elegance and functionality with our Silver Barrel Contour Pens. Designed with a sleek silver barrel, these pens offer smooth writing and customizable branding, making them an ideal choice for professionals and businesses alike. They're part of our <a href=\"../../../../pens/contour-pens/\">soft-grip contour pen range</a> at Custom Genie.</p>\n<p><strong>Details</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Digital Print Area</strong>: 60 x 6mm, perfect for showcasing your logo or message in vibrant, high-resolution color.</li>\n<li><strong>Ink Color</strong>: Black, providing a classic and professional writing experience.</li>\n<li><strong>Grip Colors</strong>: Choose from 10 rubberized options to match your style and preference.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Polished Silver Finish</strong>: The sleek and polished silver barrel gives the pen a sophisticated and professional look.</li>\n<li><strong>Custom Digital Printing</strong>: Personalize your pen with custom digital printed logos and text, ensuring your brand stands out.</li>\n<li><strong>10 Rubberized Grip Colors</strong>: Enjoy a comfortable writing experience with a choice of 10 vibrant rubberized grip colors.</li>\n<li><strong>Smooth Ink Flow</strong>: The high-quality black ink ensures smooth and consistent writing.</li>\n<li><strong>Push-to-Open Design</strong>: Convenient push-top mechanism for effortless use.</li>\n<li><strong>Durable Yet Lightweight</strong>: Crafted from premium materials, these pens are built to last while remaining lightweight for easy handling.</li>\n<li><strong>Minimalist, Professional Look</strong>: The sleek design and polished finish make these pens a perfect addition to any professional setting.</li>\n<li><strong>No Minimum Order</strong>: Order as many or as few as you need, with no minimum order requirements.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Order Your Silver Barrel Contour Pens Today!</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Elevate your writing experience with a pen that combines style, comfort, and functionality. Customize your pen with your logo and text, and make a lasting impression. Click the \"Buy Now\" button and add these elegant pens to your collection!</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
  },
